 "cues": [
  {
   "id": "1.town",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 2.5,
   "text": "In this town, I was the only one who was not a monster."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.left",
   "start": 2.5,
   "end": 4.8667,
   "text": "And we had just left my only human friend behind."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.ran",
   "start": 4.8667,
   "end": 7.7667,
   "text": "Mo told us to run east, past the pond. So we ran."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.farm",
   "start": 7.7667,
   "end": 10.5667,
   "text": "He said there was a hideout. All we found was a wrecked pig farm."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.mud",
   "start": 10.5667,
   "end": 14.1667,
   "text": "Broken fence. No pigs. And mud. A lot of mud."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.nothing",
   "start": 14.1667,
   "end": 15.8,
   "text": "\"There is nothing here,\" said my mum."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.step",
   "start": 15.8,
   "end": 18.1333,
   "text": "Then my dad took one more step, and the mud ate him."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.hole",
   "start": 18.1333,
   "end": 19.3,
   "text": "We all looked down the hole."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.wave",
   "start": 19.3,
   "end": 22.0,
   "text": "He was waving up at us. With both arms, for once."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.door",
   "start": 22.0,
   "end": 25.0667,
   "text": "It was not mud. It was a door, painted to look like mud."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.room",
   "start": 25.0667,
   "end": 27.0,
   "text": "Under it was a room as big as the village square."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.floor",
   "start": 27.0,
   "end": 29.0,
   "text": "The floor was wood. There was a well of clean water."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.food",
   "start": 29.0,
   "end": 30.7667,
   "text": "There were shelves of food, right up to the roof."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.animals",
   "start": 30.7667,
   "end": 33.2667,
   "text": "There were chickens. There were cows. There were the pigs."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.cheer",
   "start": 33.2667,
   "end": 35.3333,
   "text": "Everybody cheered. The bus jumped in the well."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.hiss",
   "start": 35.3333,
   "end": 38.3667,
   "text": "Then Hiss looked around, and said two words. \"Where is Mo?\""
  },
  {
   "id": "3.knew",
   "start": 38.3667,
   "end": 41.2667,
   "text": "I looked down at my feet. I did not have to say it. They already knew."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.ender",
   "start": 41.2667,
   "end": 43.8333,
   "text": "Then one enderman spoke. The teacher."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.trap",
   "start": 43.8333,
   "end": 45.6333,
   "text": "\"Maybe this is a trap,\" he said."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.why",
   "start": 45.6333,
   "end": 47.6,
   "text": "\"Why would a player give himself up for monsters?\""
  },
  {
   "id": "4.hole",
   "start": 47.6,
   "end": 51.2333,
   "text": "\"Maybe he wanted us all in one hole. So they could get rid of us all at once.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "4.silent",
   "start": 51.2333,
   "end": 52.3333,
   "text": "I did not say a thing."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.think",
   "start": 52.3333,
   "end": 54.9667,
   "text": "And one by one, everybody started to think it."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.looks",
   "start": 54.9667,
   "end": 59.1667,
   "text": "My mum looked at the door. My dad looked at the food. Hiss started to hiss."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.boots",
   "start": 59.1667,
   "end": 61.5333,
   "text": "Then we heard them. Boots. Right above us."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.lid",
   "start": 61.5333,
   "end": 64.6667,
   "text": "I climbed the ladder, pushed mud over the lid, and pulled the door shut."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.farm",
   "start": 64.6667,
   "end": 67.1667,
   "text": "From outside, it was only a wrecked pig farm again."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.breath",
   "start": 67.1667,
   "end": 69.5,
   "text": "We held our breath. The skeletons held their bones."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.looked",
   "start": 69.5,
   "end": 71.7667,
   "text": "They looked. And they looked. And they looked."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.stood",
   "start": 71.7667,
   "end": 74.0667,
   "text": "One of them stood on the door. The door did not move."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.left",
   "start": 74.0667,
   "end": 76.6333,
   "text": "\"Nothing here but mud,\" he said. And they left."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.sigh",
   "start": 76.6333,
   "end": 78.4,
   "text": "Forty monsters sighed at the same time."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.explore",
   "start": 78.4,
   "end": 82.7667,
   "text": "After that, we explored. It was clean. It was warm. It was cosy."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.rooms",
   "start": 82.7667,
   "end": 85.0333,
   "text": "There was a room for every family, with the name on the door."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.last",
   "start": 85.0333,
   "end": 87.2,
   "text": "The last door had no name. It was Mo's room."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.bed",
   "start": 87.2,
   "end": 90.4333,
   "text": "A bed. A spare straw hat. And a diary, on the pillow."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.open",
   "start": 90.4333,
   "end": 92.6667,
   "text": "I opened it. Every page said the same thing."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.love",
   "start": 92.6667,
   "end": 93.8333,
   "text": "\"I love my monsters.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "6.smile",
   "start": 93.8333,
   "end": 95.6,
   "text": "I smiled. Then I turned round."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.behind",
   "start": 95.6,
   "end": 98.2667,
   "text": "The whole village was standing behind me, reading over my shoulder."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.wrong",
   "start": 98.2667,
   "end": 100.7,
   "text": "The enderman looked at the floor. \"I was wrong,\" he said."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.liked",
   "start": 100.7,
   "end": 101.9333,
   "text": "\"Maybe he really did like us.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "7.ladder",
   "start": 101.9333,
   "end": 104.5333,
   "text": "I went up the ladder and lifted the lid. Nobody was there."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.grab",
   "start": 104.5333,
   "end": 106.3667,
   "text": "I climbed out. My dad grabbed for me."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.arm",
   "start": 106.3667,
   "end": 109.4333,
   "text": "He got my shirt. I got away. His arm came with me."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.head",
   "start": 109.4333,
   "end": 111.7667,
   "text": "I had only one thing in my head. Where is Mo?"
  },
  {
   "id": "7.ran",
   "start": 111.7667,
   "end": 113.4333,
   "text": "I ran, and I ran."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.tree",
   "start": 113.4333,
   "end": 115.7,
   "text": "Then I saw players on the road, and I hid behind a tree."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.houses",
   "start": 115.7,
   "end": 119.2,
   "text": "So I went through the houses instead. In one door, out the window, into the next."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.street",
   "start": 119.2,
   "end": 121.2667,
   "text": "House by house, all the way back to my street."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.ground",
   "start": 121.2667,
   "end": 123.4333,
   "text": "And there, in the middle of it, on the ground."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.sword",
   "start": 123.4333,
   "end": 125.2333,
   "text": "Mo's sword. And Mo's helmet."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.gone",
   "start": 125.2333,
   "end": 126.2333,
   "text": "Mo was not there."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.sub",
   "start": 126.2333,
   "end": 128.0667,
   "text": "Like and subscribe for part three."
  }
 ],
